# E14 (opt-in argument e14, README E14 section): per-export reachability with the all-exports obligation,
# stack pointers below the entry SP, and offsets bounded by value ranges and dominating CMP/B.cond checks.
# Controls without e14 keep the E13 whole-artifact behaviour: the same fixtures revoke and stay NOT_RUN.
scan-e14-stack-default run seed/qualification/om2/leak/leakscan.om file:seed/qualification/om2/leak/fixtures/e14-stack.bin file:seed/qualification/om2/leak/expected/e14-stack-default.out - 2 pub:0:32:8
